  "description": "Beautiful Large 2 bedroomed Apartment, tastefully decorated; comprises the following:- \n\nEntrance Hall featuring cream porcelain floor tiles, smoke alarm and sprinkler system.\n\nMain Bathroom to include  bath & shower together with large recessed Vanity unit & large in-built Mirror together with a concealed cistern.  This bathroom is beautifully tiled around the bath, vanity unit and floor.\n\nBedroom 1: Master Bedroom consists of large double built-in wardrobes, beautiful new wooden floor with walnut double bed (brand new mattress), walnut bedside tables to include two beautiful bedside lamps, It also has a large walnut chest of drawers as part of the suite.  TV connection is provided also. This room includes cream full length mirror mounted to side of wardrobe. Child safety window lock on large bedroom window.  \n\nEn-suite Bathroom in Master Bedroom:  Beautifully fully tiled bathroom,  The shower features attractive recessed unit within the shower space together with recessed wall unit with mirror located outside shower also.  It has a large frosted hopper window which can be tilted, opened inwards and adjusted accordingly.  The bathroom features a heated towel rail.     \n\nBedroom 2: Grey Hemnes single/double Bed with 3 large storage drawers and two good mattresses.  This bed compliments the beautiful newly laid wooden floor. The room also features a built-in wardrobe together with desk and chair. Child safety window lock on large bedroom window. \n\n5. Storage Room: Large storage room with storage shelving unit to house your storage.  Also features two good sized coats rail.\n\n6. Hot Press : This room features a large water tank, insulated water cylinder and shelving with ample space to air laundry.\n \n7. Kitchen: fully integrated Appliances to include, Fridge/freezer, Dishwasher, Washing Machine, Oven and new Hob. A brand new boiler has been installed.(Gas central heating).  Sash double glazed window, lots of electric socket points, a smoke alarm and carbon monoxide detector.  Separate drinking water tap provided also.\n\nLoungeroom: Beautiful and comfortable loungeroom which has a large double glazed window and door leading to the balcony which features weatherproof table and chairs and overlooks a lovely and well maintained garden. \nThis room is spacious and some features include, Dining Table & Chairs. It also includes an attractive spacious Dresser Unit to house delve, cutlery etc. A separate corner drinks and glasses cabinet is also included.  Beautiful lamp and table is situated beside a comfortable champagne sofa.  Cream floor tiles throughout Kitchen/Lounge.  It also comes with a TV Unit, 48\" Samsung TV, Surround Sound System, Subwoofer and free to air channels included.   \n\nThis Apartment is homely and in a pristine condition. It is situated in a quiet complex which is ideally located close to all amenities, in the heart of Ashbourne.  It's a stone's throw from the village, 2 minute walk to the nearest Bus stop which departs every 20 minutes to Dublin City Centre.  There are Buses to Swords, Dublin Airport, Blanchardstown, Navan and beyond.  Schools, creches, and a large variety of shops are all close by and abundant making it a superbly conveniently placed Apartment.    \n    \nThis Apartment also boasts an underground car park which makes it a pleasant experience in the depths of winter. It's also a secure environment for your car.  \n\n*****Viewing by Appointment Only**********.",
